    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Jaak (<a href=\"https://jaaknow.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">jaaknow.com</a>) provides you with drivers in Kuwait to deliver your orders. &#8220;Jaak&#8221; is like &#8220;Uber&#8221;, but for your WooCommerce orders.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Shows you order delivery status directly in WooCommerce order page.</li>\n<li>Shows you the delivery price up-front.</li>\n<li>Groups deliveries based on geographic location to reduce delivery costs.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Install and activate the Jaak for WooCommerce plugin.</li>\n<li>Add your Jaak API key.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>More info is available on the <a href=\"https://jaaknow.com/site/en/docs/#connect-woocommerce-store\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Jaak</a> website.</p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"How to install Jaak for WooCommerce\" width=\"750\" height=\"563\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6UFWRYm100s?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Order delivery in Kuwait.",
    "description": "<p>Jaak (<a href=\"https://jaaknow.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">jaaknow.com</a>) provides you with drivers in Kuwait to deliver your orders. &#8220;Jaak&#8221; is like &#8220;Uber&#8221;, but for your WooCommerce orders.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Shows you order delivery status directly in WooCommerce order page.</li>\n<li>Shows you the delivery price up-front.</li>\n<li>Groups deliveries based on geographic location to reduce delivery costs.</li>\n</ul>\n",
